      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. i'll probably try to avoid the rush hours then. one more thing—since i'm traveling alone, i'm also thinking about the overall \"vibe\" of the travel. between the transit options, does one feel more seamless or easier to navigate for someone who isn't super familiar with the local transit systems? like, is there anything that might trip me up or cause unexpected headaches while i'm moving between cities?",
